## Discussion format
The talk proceeds in {{ period_name }}s. Each {{ period_name }} has {{ turns_per_round }} turns; in each turn, every participant speaks once, in this fixed order: {{ speaking_order_names }}. On a turn, a participant either speaks, says "{{ pass_skip }}" (passes this turn only), or says "{{ pass_over }}" (takes no further turns this {{ period_name }}). An utterance is anywhere from 1 to {{ word_cap }} words; give it the length and content that suit the moment. An utterance consists only of the participant's own words: no name labels, headings, stage directions or commentary, and no speaking for others.
